  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow punches through one of your floating ribs to lacerate a kidney. This results in massive blood loss as the kidney’s job is to filtrate your entire blood volume over and over again. You’ll run out of blood in no time!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (1) and @Condition[Bleeding] (3), the latter of which cannot be removed without Surgery.</p><p><strong>Surgery (Very Hard)</strong> is required for Extraction, which will count as resolving an internal issue due to the arrowhead having ended up so deep inside a body cavity.</p>"
    },
